{"seq":3,"slug":"dependency-security-agents","title":"依赖与安全 Agent","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-cicd/agent-workflows/dependency-security-agents","wordCount":812,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"依赖与安全-agent\">依赖与安全 Agent</h1><p>依赖管理和安全漏洞扫描是软件供应链安全的关键防线，也是 CI/CD 流水线中最适合 AI 增强的场景之一。传统的 Dependabot 和 Renovate 能够检测过时依赖和已知 CVE，但它们是基于规则的工具——无法判断某个升级对当前代码库的实际影响，也无法生成适合当前代码语境的升级指南。</p>\n<p>AI Agent 在这个场景上的增量价值：理解 changelog 语义、评估升级风险、生成针对当前代码库的迁移建议，以及在安全告警中区分&quot;理论上存在 CVE&quot;和&quot;在当前代码中实际可利用&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>依赖升级风险评估</strong>（Upgrade Risk Assessment）指 agent 读取依赖包的 changelog，结合当前代码库对该依赖的使用方式（调用了哪些 API），评估升级的风险等级和所需工作量。</p>\n<p><strong>可达性分析</strong>（Reachability Analysis）指判断某个已知 CVE 的漏洞路径在当前代码库中是否实际可达（代码中是否调用了漏洞函数，且调用链是否可被外部触发）。不可达的 CVE 虽然需要记录，但不需要紧急修复。</p>\n<p><strong>供应链 SBOM</strong>（Software Bill of Materials）是软件物料清单，列出所有直接和传递依赖的版本和来源。AI agent 可以辅助生成和维护 SBOM，并将其与 CVE 数据库关联。</p>\n<h2 id=\"依赖与安全-agent-的工作模式\">依赖与安全 Agent 的工作模式</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    DAILY[每日定时任务] --&gt; SCAN[扫描依赖树]&#10;    PR[PR 变更依赖文件] --&gt; SCAN&#10;&#10;    SCAN --&gt; CVE{CVE 数据库\\n匹配}&#10;    SCAN --&gt; OUTDATED{过时依赖\\n检测}&#10;&#10;    CVE --&gt;|发现 CVE| REACH[可达性分析]&#10;    REACH --&gt;|可达 + 高危| URGENT[紧急安全 PR\\n+ 告警通知]&#10;    REACH --&gt;|不可达 / 低危| LOG[记录 + 低优先级 Issue]&#10;&#10;    OUTDATED --&gt; RISK[AI 升级风险评估]&#10;    RISK --&gt;|低风险| AUTO_PR[自动创建升级 PR]&#10;    RISK --&gt;|中风险| GUIDED_PR[创建带迁移指南的升级 PR]&#10;    RISK --&gt;|高风险| ISSUE[创建 Issue + 不自动升级]\">flowchart TD\n    DAILY[每日定时任务] --&gt; SCAN[扫描依赖树]\n    PR[PR 变更依赖文件] --&gt; SCAN\n\n    SCAN --&gt; CVE{CVE 数据库\\n匹配}\n    SCAN --&gt; OUTDATED{过时依赖\\n检测}\n\n    CVE --&gt;|发现 CVE| REACH[可达性分析]\n    REACH --&gt;|可达 + 高危| URGENT[紧急安全 PR\\n+ 告警通知]\n    REACH --&gt;|不可达 / 低危| LOG[记录 + 低优先级 Issue]\n\n    OUTDATED --&gt; RISK[AI 升级风险评估]\n    RISK --&gt;|低风险| AUTO_PR[自动创建升级 PR]\n    RISK --&gt;|中风险| GUIDED_PR[创建带迁移指南的升级 PR]\n    RISK --&gt;|高风险| ISSUE[创建 Issue + 不自动升级]</pre><h2 id=\"cve-安全扫描与可达性分析\">CVE 安全扫描与可达性分析</h2><p>纯规则匹配 CVE 的问题是误报率高：npm audit 列出的 vulnerabilities 中，大多数在当前代码库中并不可达。AI 辅助可达性分析能显著降低告警噪音：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// scripts/security-audit.mjs&#10;async function analyzeVulnerabilityReachability(cve, codebase) {&#10;  const { affectedPackage, affectedFunction, cvssScore } = cve;&#10;&#10;  // 1. 在代码库中查找对漏洞函数的调用&#10;  const callSites = await findCallSites(codebase, affectedPackage, affectedFunction);&#10;&#10;  if (callSites.length === 0) {&#10;    return {&#10;      reachable: false,&#10;      reason: `Function ${affectedFunction} from ${affectedPackage} is not called in this codebase`,&#10;      recommendation: &#39;log_only&#39;,&#10;    };&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 2. AI 分析调用链是否可被外部触发&#10;  const reachabilityAnalysis = await anthropic.messages.create({&#10;    model: &#39;claude-sonnet-4-5&#39;,&#10;    max_tokens: 2048,&#10;    messages: [&#10;      {&#10;        role: &#39;user&#39;,&#10;        content: `CVE: ${cve.id} - ${cve.description}&#10;Affected function: ${affectedPackage}.${affectedFunction}&#10;CVSS Score: ${cvssScore}&#10;&#10;Call sites found in codebase:&#10;${callSites.map((s) =&gt; `- ${s.file}:${s.line}: ${s.context}`).join(&#39;\\n&#39;)}&#10;&#10;Analyze: Is this vulnerability reachable from external inputs (HTTP requests, file uploads, user input)?&#10;If yes, what is the attack vector?&#10;Output JSON: { reachable: bool, attack_vector: string, severity_in_context: &quot;critical|high|medium|low&quot;, recommendation: string }`,&#10;      },&#10;    ],&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return JSON.parse(reachabilityAnalysis.content[0].text);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// scripts/security-audit.mjs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> analyzeVulnerabilityReachability</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">codebase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">affectedPackage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">affectedFunction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cvssScore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cve;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 1. 在代码库中查找对漏洞函数的调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> callSites</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findCallSites</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(codebase, affectedPackage, affectedFunction);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (callSites.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      reachable: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Function ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">affectedFunction</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} from ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">affectedPackage</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} is not called in this codebase`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      recommendation: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'log_only'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 2. AI 分析调用链是否可被外部触发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> reachabilityAnalysis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> anthropic.messages.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'claude-sonnet-4-5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    max_tokens: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2048</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    messages: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        role: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        content: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`CVE: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cve</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">id</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} - ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cve</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">description</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Affected function: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">affectedPackage</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}.${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">affectedFunction</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CVSS Score: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cvssScore</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Call sites found in codebase:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">callSites</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">((</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `- ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">file</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">line</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">context</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Analyze: Is this vulnerability reachable from external inputs (HTTP requests, file uploads, user input)?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">If yes, what is the attack vector?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Output JSON: { reachable: bool, attack_vector: string, severity_in_context: \"critical|high|medium|low\", recommendation: string }`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(reachabilityAnalysis.content[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].text);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"依赖升级风险评估\">依赖升级风险评估</h2><p>不是所有依赖升级都可以安全地自动化。Risk 评估框架：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"async function assessUpgradeRisk(pkg, currentVersion, targetVersion, codebase) {&#10;  // 获取 changelog&#10;  const changelog = await fetchChangelog(pkg, currentVersion, targetVersion);&#10;&#10;  // 分析 breaking changes&#10;  const hasBreaking =&#10;    changelog.toLowerCase().includes(&#39;breaking&#39;) || semver.major(targetVersion) &gt; semver.major(currentVersion);&#10;&#10;  // 分析代码库中对该包的使用方式&#10;  const usageReport = await analyzePackageUsage(pkg, codebase);&#10;&#10;  const prompt = `Package upgrade risk assessment:&#10;Package: ${pkg}&#10;Current: ${currentVersion} → Target: ${targetVersion}&#10;Changelog summary: ${changelog.slice(0, 2000)}&#10;&#10;Current usage in codebase:&#10;${JSON.stringify(usageReport, null, 2)}&#10;&#10;Assess:&#10;1. risk_level: low/medium/high&#10;2. breaking_changes: list of breaking changes that affect this codebase&#10;3. migration_steps: step-by-step upgrade guide specific to the current usage&#10;4. estimated_effort: &quot;&lt; 1 hour&quot; / &quot;1-4 hours&quot; / &quot;&gt; 4 hours&quot;&#10;5. auto_merge_safe: bool (safe to auto-merge without human review)&#10;&#10;Output JSON.`;&#10;&#10;  const response = await anthropic.messages.create({&#10;    model: &#39;claude-opus-4-5&#39;,&#10;    max_tokens: 3000,&#10;    messages: [{ role: &#39;user&#39;, content: prompt }],&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return JSON.parse(response.content[0].text);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> assessUpgradeRisk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pkg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">currentVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">targetVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">codebase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 获取 changelog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> changelog</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchChangelog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pkg, currentVersion, targetVersion);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 分析 breaking changes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> hasBreaking</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    changelog.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toLowerCase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'breaking'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> semver.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B